## H I G H L I G H T S
• Flower-like bimetallic MOF-derived carbon composites.  • Regulate structures by adjusting different precursor ratios.  • High-efficiency microwave absorption of \(-56.89\) dB with wide bandwidth of \(4.7\:\mathrm{GHz}\).  • Synergistic effect of unique structure and electromagnetic characteristic for EWA.
G R A P H I C A L A B S T R A C T
## A R T I C L E I N F O
